{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/items/397613/", "pk": 397613, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/", "pk": 335, "shortname": "bodyglove", "name": "Body Glove Hawaii", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Super-Raft Snorkel - AM", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 8, "unicode": "Super-Raft Snorkel - AM", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1000, "description": "Step aboard our luxurious 41ft Super-Raft for a fun filled morning on the water. Enjoy the thrill of a raft ride with none of the drawbacks. Our vessel is equipped with tons of seating, shade, and a bathroom! \n\nThis tour heads south of Kona to two of Kona's most underrated snorkeling sites. Unlike many other tours our 4 hour intimate trip offers in water guides to enhance your snorkeling experience.\n\nThis tour includes:\n-Snorkeling gear\n-Picnic lunch\n-Sunscreen\n-Soft drinks & Snacks", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Kailua Pier", "booking_notes": "#Mahalo for booking with Body Glove Cruises\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you for your Super-Raft Snorkel Tour!\n\nFree parking is available at our retail shop in Ilima Court Shopping Center. The address is 75-5629 Kuakini Highway, Kailua Kona, HI 96740. It's about a 5-7 minute walk down to the pier. Boarding begins 30 minutes prior to departure.\n\n##Discover unique, locally made treasures in our gift shop [The Boatique](https://www.instagram.com/theboatiquehi/)—show this email for 10% off your purchase!\n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/cGKvVAYQeO8QiavAeq1K)\n\n***\n#Boat Information:\n\n- This tour takes place on the [Kona Explorer](https://www.bodyglovehawaii.com/our-boat), our 41 ft. Super Raft.\n- Please note that our vessel is a **SMOKE FREE** vessel.\n- Our boat requires you to be physically agile and able to navigate the boarding process with ease, this is to ensure the safety of all passengers and crew on board.\n- If you have concerns about your ability to board the boat, we encourage you to speak with one of our crew members who will be happy to assist you in finding the best solution.\n\n***\n#Included On This Trip:\n\n- All your snorkeling gear\n- Picnic lunch\n- Reef safe sunscreen\n- Soft drinks & snacks\n- Prescription snorkel masks from -1.5 to -7.0 are available with 24 hour advance notice.\n Please have prescription strength available when requesting.\n\n**Please Bring:**\nTowel\n***\n#Special Dietary Requests:\nFor gluten-free, vegetarian, or vegan meals, please call 800.551.8911 at least **48 hours** before your adventure.\n\n##Due to extreme exposure to Fun & Excitement, we unfortunately cannot welcome children five years and younger, or pregnant women on this tour.##", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 30, "headline": "Speedboat Snorkel • 4 hours • Adventure and Comfort", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/items/397613/images/885098/", "pk": 885098, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cd